\f0\fs26 \cf0 The ferry left at dusk and the lamps came on one by one.
\f1\fs24 \{\\Scrv_fn=
\f0\fs26  Lamps were lit by hand until the flood.
\f1\fs24 \\end_Scrv_fn\}
\f0\fs26 \
Oona counted {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "scrivcmt://C0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000001"}}{\fldrslt nine lamps}} where there should have been ten.\
The toll keeper said nothing. 
\f1\fs24 \{\\Scrv_annot \\color=\{\\R=0.543234\\G=0.0\\B=0.023817\} \\text=
\f0\fs26 CHECK HIS NAME.
\f1\fs24 \\end_Scrv_annot\}
\f0\fs26  He only held out his hand.\
She paid with the last of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "scrivcmt://C0000002-0000-4000-8000-000000000002"}}{\fldrslt salt money}}.\
The water was colder than the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "scrivcmt://C0000003-0000-4000-8000-000000000003"}}{\fldrslt almanac}} promised.}